  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Add an optional properties dialog mode to the workflow editor by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/195\n* Select, highlight and center a problem's node or edge (both properties modes) by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/196\n* Let hosts switch off Import, Export, Image and Simulate by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/197\n* Update dependency typescript-eslint to v8.71.2 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/194\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/compare/v3.0.1...v3.0.2",
